{
 "info": {
  "name": "Decidiq Meeting Pack (Board Book) Contract Suite",
  "description": "Wire contract of the compiled meeting pack (openspec/changes/meeting-pack-board-book, task 9):\n\n  POST /api/meetings/{id}/board-book         boardBook#compile   401 / 403 (not chair or secretary) / 422 empty_agenda / 202 queued with nextVersion\n  GET  /api/meetings/{id}/board-book/status  boardBook#status    200 contract shape / 401 / 403 (no participant) / 404 unknown meeting\n\nThe administrator stands in for the secretary (MeetingRoleGate lets an administrator compile). The 202 request queues BoardBookCompileJob; this suite does not wait for it, so the status request accepts any non-idle state. Self-contained and idempotent: it seeds a stranger probe user, a governance body, a meeting with one agenda item and an empty meeting, and deletes them, plus any MeetingPack a compile job created, in teardown.\n\n@spec openspec/changes/meeting-pack-board-book/specs/meeting-pack-board-book/spec.md\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2\nSPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Conduction B.V. <info@conduction.nl>",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
 "auth": {
  "type": "noauth"
 },
